WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.770
The first speaker is ready. The deck is up
next. And your guests are still arriving.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:09.682
VNV Events brings the venue, the technical
team,

00:00:09.913 --> 00:00:12.462
and hospitality into one production plan.

00:00:13.088 --> 00:00:17.154
For a conference, a launch, or a client
gathering,

00:00:17.462 --> 00:00:20.220
we build the run of show and coordinate
each handoff.

00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:24.616
That covers sound, presentations, service,
and staffing.

00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:29.341
If you need RSVP and check-in, we can plan
that too.

00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:33.392
Tell us what you want the event to
accomplish.

00:00:33.755 --> 00:00:35.579
We’ll build the production around it.
